  "notes": {
    "title": "Nightmare and public highscores",
    "summary": "Nightmare opens after a full Hard clear with that heroine. The hub now has public highscores for Nightmare, with a separate opt-in to share your future qualifying times.",
    "changes": [
      "Clear each Nightmare tier to unlock the next one for that heroine. Scores count active attempt time across the full run.",
      "Arena encounter compositions are seeded, and the run guide shows the Twins encounter.",
      "The arena progress strip shows encounter milestones. Boss rewards have a short reveal you can tap to skip.",
      "Browse Nightmare highscores by tier from the hub. Publishing future qualifying scores requires a separate opt-in, and adding a display name is optional."
    ]
  }
